{"t":"KMB","made":"2026-11-11 00:34","name":"Kimberly-Clark Corporation","ko":null,"sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Household & Personal Products","employees":36000,"hq":"Dallas, TX, United States","website":"https://www.kimberly-clark.com","summary_en":"Kimberly-Clark Corporation, together with its subsidiaries, manufactures and markets personal care products in the United States. It operates in two segments, North America and International Personal Care. The North America segment offers disposable diapers, training and youth pants, swimpants, baby wipes, feminine and incontinence care products, reusable underwear, facial and bathroom tissue, paper towels, napkins, wipers, tissue, towels, soaps and sanitizers, and other related products under the Huggies, Pull-Ups, Goodnites, Kotex, Poise, Depend, Kleenex, Scott, Cottonelle, Viva, Wypall, and other brand names. Its International Personal Care segment provides baby and child care, adult care and feminine care, including disposable diapers, training and youth pants, swimpants, baby wipes, feminine and incontinence care products, reusable underwear, and other related products under the Huggies, Kotex, Goodfeel, Intimus, Depend, and other brand names. The company sells its household use products directly to supermarkets, mass merchandisers, drugstores, warehouse clubs, variety and department stores, and other retail outlets, as well as through other distributors and e-commerce. It also sells its professional use products through distributors directly to manufacturing, lodging, office building, food service, and high-volume public facilities, as well as through e-commerce. Kimberly-Clark Corporation was founded in 1872 and is headquartered in Dallas, Texas.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Kimberly-Clark Corporation은 자회사와 함께 미국에서 개인 위생 제품을 제조 및 판매합니다. 북미와 국제 퍼스널 케어의 두 부문으로 운영됩니다. 북미 부문에서는 Huggies, Pull-Ups, Goodnites, Kotex, Poise, Didend, Kleenex, Scott, Cottonelle, Viva, Wypall 및 기타 브랜드 이름으로 일회용 기저귀, 트레이닝 및 청소년용 바지, 수영팬츠, 유아용 물티슈, 여성 및 요실금 관리 제품, 재사용 가능한 속옷, 얼굴 및 욕실 티슈, 종이 타월, 냅킨, 와이퍼, 티슈, 타월, 비누 및 소독제 및 기타 관련 제품을 제공합니다. 국제 개인 관리 부문에서는 Huggies, Kotex, Goodfeel, Intimus, Did 및 기타 브랜드 이름으로 일회용 기저귀, 훈련용 및 청소년용 바지, 수영복, 유아용 물티슈, 여성 및 요실금 관리 제품, 재사용 가능한 속옷 및 기타 관련 제품을 포함한 유아 및 아동 관리, 성인 관리 및 여성 관리를 제공합니다. 이 회사는 가정용 제품을 슈퍼마켓, 대량 판매점, 약국, 창고형 클럽, 잡화점, 백화점, 기타 소매점에 직접 판매할 뿐만 아니라 기타 유통업체 및 전자상거래를 통해 판매합니다. 또한 전문가용 제품을 유통업체를 통해 제조, 숙박, 오피스빌딩, 요식업, 대규모 공공시설 등 전자상거래를 통해 직접 판매하고 있습니다. Kimberly-Clark Corporation은 1872년에 설립되었으며 텍사스 주 달라스에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":111.33,"mcap":68320477184.0,"pe":21.246185,"fpe":15.629102,"peg":2.2421,"ps":4.1241384,"pb":12.629609,"ev_ebitda":11.891,"div":4.57,"beta":0.276,"hi52":116.82,"lo52":92.42},"fin":{"rev":16565999616.0,"rev_g":-0.004,"eps_g":3.007,"gross":0.37305,"op":0.16545999,"net":0.19931999,"roe":0.78379995,"fcf":1602125056.0,"cash":1874000000.0,"debt":6512999936.0,"de":211.874,"eps":5.24,"feps":7.12325},"own":{"short":0.1736,"inst":0.53398,"insider":0.00393},"analyst":{"n":15,"mean":118.53333,"median":115.0,"high":162.0,"low":90.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":2.4375,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":3,"buy":4,"hold":8,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":3,"buy":4,"hold":9,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":3,"buy":4,"hold":8,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":3,"buy":4,"hold":8,"sell":1,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-09","Firm":"BNP Paribas","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":112.0,"priorPriceTarget":110.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-09","Firm":"Barclays","ToGrade":"Equal-Weight","FromGrade":"Equal-Weight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":112.0,"priorPriceTarget":106.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-06","Firm":"Piper Sandler","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTar